# Keep the build context small and reproducible: never ship host build outputs
# (they hold -march=native binaries for the DEV CPU and would be rebuilt anyway),
# VCS/editor state, or Python caches. The Docker build re-configures and
# re-compiles from source inside the CUDA image.
#
# This is a BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore (named <Dockerfile>.dockerignore), so
# it is honored when building with `docker build -f cloud/Dockerfile .`. Paths are
# relative to the build context (the repo root).
build/
build-*/
.git/
.idea/
.vs/
.vscode/
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.exe
*.csv
*.pt
pieces/
compile_commands.json
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
